<view class="page"><view class="head-row"><view><view class="eyebrow">记录一口真实体验</view><view class="title">分享这一口</view><view class="sub">不用写得很专业，告诉同好值不值得吃</view></view><view class="step">1 / 2</view></view><view class="sub">让同好知道，这道菜到底值不值得吃</view><view class="photo" bindtap="chooseImage">{{image?'':'＋'}}<image wx:if="{{image}}" src="{{image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text wx:if="{{!image}}">上传美食照片</text></view><input placeholder="菜品名称，例如：招牌牛肉面" value="{{dishName}}" bindinput="onName"/><input placeholder="店铺名称（选填）" value="{{store}}" bindinput="onStore"/><textarea class="note" maxlength="1000" placeholder="说说为什么许吃？口感、分量、价格都可以（选填）" value="{{note}}" bindinput="onNote"/><view class="label">口味标签 <text class="hint">选 1～4 个</text></view><view class="tags"><text wx:for="{{tagOptions}}" wx:key="*this" class="tag {{tags.indexOf(item)>=0?'on':''}}" data-tag="{{item}}" bindtap="toggleTag">{{item}}</text></view><view class="label">你的态度</view><view class="status"><button data-status="yes" bindtap="setStatus">❤️ 许吃</button><button data-status="conditional" bindtap="setStatus">🤔 有条件</button><button data-status="no" bindtap="setStatus">👎 不许吃</button></view><view class="current">告诉同好你的真实态度 · 会影响以后推荐</view><button class="submit" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">发布</button></view>